OpenCut is an independent open-source video editor for Android.

Everything in this repository — the source code, the logo, the launcher icon and
the documentation — was written from scratch for this project. The app works
completely offline: it talks to no server and to no third party service, and it
only reads and writes files on the device.

All names, the logo and the launcher icon in this project are original artwork
created for it. No artwork, font, audio, template or code of any other project is
included or redistributed here.

OpenCut is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any commercial video
editor. See docs/PROVIDERS.md for the optional self-hosted content catalogue,
which only serves assets that carry a licence.

